'''''Solenostoma''''' is a genus of [[liverwort]]s belonging to the family [[Solenostomataceae]].<ref name="GBIF">{{cite web |title=''Solenostoma'' Mitt. |url=https://www.gbif.org/species/8123202 |website=www.gbif.org |access-date=24 June 2023 |language=en}}</ref>

The species of this genus has a [[cosmopolitan distribution]].<ref name="GBIF" />

